# Naver Search Ad API credentials
# Issue: 네이버 검색광고 센터 → 도구 → API 사용관리 → API 사용자 생성

NAVER_ADS_CUSTOMER_ID=your-customer-id
NAVER_ADS_ACCESS_LICENSE=your-access-license
NAVER_ADS_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key

# Note: Web automation (Playwright using ID/PW) is NOT supported by this project
# because Naver Search Ad API provides everything needed for the in-scope sheets.
# See README.md for the brand-search exclusion rationale.
